{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:54:04+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:54:04+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Lisi S.A.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"France","city":"Belfort","website":"https://www.lisi-group.com","employees":9455,"summary":"Lisi S.A. designs and produces assembly and component solutions for the aerospace, automotive, and medical sectors in France and internationally. The company operates through three segments: LISI Aerospace and LISI Automotive. It offers OPTIBLIND, high pressure hydraulic fitting, latch, RIB fitting, TYX, and O-ring products; and manufactures fastener and structural assembly components for aircraft manufacturers. The company also provides cable channel, guide rods and electric parking brakes, sealing screws, and standard automotive clop; and metal and plastic assembly solutions, and safety mechanical components for automotive manufacturers and suppliers. The company was formerly known as GFI Industries and changed its name to Lisi S.A. in 2002. Lisi S.A. was founded in 1777 and is headquartered in Belfort, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Lisi S.A. conçoit et produit des solutions d’assemblage et de composants pour les secteurs de l’aéronautique, de l’automobile et du médical en France et à l’international. La société opère à travers trois segments: LISI Aerospace et LISI Automotive. Elle propose des produits OPTIBLIND, raccord hydraulique haute pression, loquet, raccord RIB, TYX et joint torique; et fabrique des composants de fixation et d'assemblage structurel pour les constructeurs d'avions."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":2788723456,"shares_outstanding":45716777,"trailing_pe":32.62032,"forward_pe":17.340778,"price_to_book":2.458785,"ev_to_ebitda":12.249,"ev_to_revenue":1.627,"dividend_yield":0.0075,"payout_ratio":0.227